            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The invention relates to a nucleic acid sequence useful in the treatment of hyperbilirubinemia, in particular in the treatment of Crigler-Najjar syndrome. More particularly, the nucleic acid sequence of the present invention is a codon-optimized UGT1A1 coding sequence.</p>
            </abstract>
